### Coffee Shop - Operation Service manual test requests
### Run `uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8002` from operation_service/ first.
### Get an access token from user_service (POST /user/login) and paste it below.
### The token's "role" claim must be admin/staff for the product-management calls.

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8002
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_OR_STAFF_ACCESS_TOKEN
@customerToken = REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Add a product (admin/staff only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/product
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cappuccino",
  "description": "Espresso with steamed milk foam",
  "price": 4.00,
  "initial_stock": 25
}

###

### List products (public, paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/product?page=1&page_size=10&active_only=true

###

### Get a single product
GET {{baseUrl}}/product/1

###

### Update a product (admin/staff only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/product/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cappuccino",
  "description": "Espresso with steamed milk foam",
  "price": 4.25,
  "is_active": true
}

###

### Manually adjust stock, e.g. restock (admin/staff only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/product/1/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "change_quantity": 10,
  "reason": "restock",
  "reference": "supplier delivery #45"
}

###

### Create an order (any authenticated user)
POST {{baseUrl}}/order
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "product_id": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

###

### List my orders (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/order?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###

### Get a specific order
GET {{baseUrl}}/order/1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###

### Pay for an order
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/1/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "card"
}

###

### Check payment status for an order
GET {{baseUrl}}/order/1/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###

### Staff/admin updates order status (e.g. mark completed after paid)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/order/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

###

### Customer cancels their own pending order (restocks automatically)
POST {{baseUrl}}/order/2/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###

### Deactivate a product (soft delete, admin/staff only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/product/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
